.SS float
.sp
Artificial, floating point\-heavy benchmark originally used by Factor.
.sp
Create 100,000 point objects which compute \fBmath.cos()\fP, \fBmath.sin()\fP and
\fBmath.sqrt()\fP
.sp
Changed in version 0.5.5: Use \fB__slots__\fP on the Point class to focus the benchmark on float rather
than testing performance of class attributes.

