where \fBpython\fP is \fBsys.executable\fP
.IP \(bu 2
\fBpython_startup_nosite\fP: Measure the Python startup time without importing
the \fBsite\fP module, run \fBpython \-S \-c pass\fP where \fBpython\fP is
