.SS pidigits
.sp
Calculating 2,000 digits of π.  This benchmark stresses big integer arithmetic.
.sp
Command line option:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
\-\-digits DIGITS     Number of computed pi digits (default: 2000)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
