.sp
\(dqdynamic\(dq is required by PEP 621 for when a field will be filled in
dynamically by the tool.  This is especially important for required
fields.
.sp
All other PEP 621 fields are optional (e.g. \fBrequires\-python = \(dq>=3.8\(dq\fP,
\fB{repository = \(dqhttps://github.com/...\(dq}\fP).
